 "text": "Menominee County | Government | Services\nGovernment\nAgendas & Minutes\nBoards & Committees\nEmployment\nForms & Documents\nMunicipalities\nServices\nDepartments\n9-1-1 (Central Dispatch)\nAdministration\nBuilding Codes\nClerk\nCounty Board of Commissioners\nCounty Fair\nCourts\nEmergency Management\nEqualization\nFriend of the Court\nLand Information Services (GIS)\nMenominee County Library\nMenominee Regional Airport\nParks & Recreation\nProsecuting Attorney\nRegister of Deeds\nRoad Commission\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nVeteran Services\nCommunity\nArea Information\nCUPPAD\nM & M Regional Guide\nMenominee Conservation District\nMenominee County 4-H\nMichigan Department of Health & Human Services\nMichigan State University - Extension\nNorthpointe Behavioral Health\nPublic Health - Delta & Menominee Counties\nUPCAP - Upper Peninsula Commission for Area Progress\nMore\nCalendar\nContact Us\nEmail Alerts\nFAQ\nLinks\nNews\nStaff Directory\n-->\nServices\nAll |\nA - D |\nE - H |\nI - L |\nM - P |\nQ - T |\nU - Z |\n|\nFingerprint Background Checks |\n| -->\nThe Sheriff's Office provides LiveScan fingerprint background checks by appointment only. Call 906-863-4441 x2503 to schedule an appointment. |\n|\nFirearms and Concealed Weapon Permits |\n| -->\nInformation on firearms purchases, gun registrations, and the Concealed Pistol License application process. |\n|\nPay Delinquent Property Tax |\n| -->\nPay prior years' property tax to Menominee County Treasurer.\nFor current year property tax, make payment to your local city or township treasurer. |\n|\nProject Lifesaver |\n| -->\nProject Lifesaver is an electronic search and rescue program for individuals who are at risk of wandering. Participants are provided with a trackable radio frequency transmitter that is worn on the wrist or ankle. |\n|\nVolunteer Units |\n| -->\nThe Menominee County Sheriff's Office oversees a number of volunteer units that provide critical services within our county. |\nCopyright © 2026 Me